# Financial Risk Prediction Using Econometric and Machine Learning Approaches

## Research Objective

This project investigates whether machine learning approaches can improve financial risk prediction compared with traditional econometric methods.

The study integrates financial analytics, econometric modeling, and artificial intelligence to develop accurate and interpretable financial risk prediction models.

## Research Question

Can corporate financial indicators predict financial risk, and which analytical approaches provide reliable and interpretable predictions?

## Research Approach

This project follows the workflow:

1. Data Collection
2. Data Cleaning
3. Exploratory Data Analysis
4. Feature Engineering
5. Econometric Modeling
6. Machine Learning Development
7. Model Evaluation
8. Explainable AI Interpretation
